（Production Ready），提供成熟的 FHIR 資源儲存、驗證與查詢功能。","locale":"zh-TW"},"30":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#核心章節導覽","content":"**簡介與能力聲明**\\\n了解 Burni 的核心設計目標、FHIR R4 合規性以及 AEGIS Touchstone 測試通過指標（100% 通過）。","locale":"zh-TW"},"31":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#核心章節導覽","content":"**快速開始**\\\n包含伺服器環境安裝（Windows / Linux）、`.env` 與伺服器參數設定，以及正式環境部署建議。","locale":"zh-TW"},"32":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#核心章節導覽","content":"**FHIR API 規格文件**\\\n詳細介紹 Burni 提供的 FHIR RESTful 交互介面（CRUD、vread、history 等）與 OpenAPI / Swagger 規格產生方式。","locale":"zh-TW"},"33":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#核心章節導覽","content":"**搜尋參數 (Search Parameters)**\\\n說明 FHIR Search 機制、自定義搜尋參數的擴展方法與 MongoDB 查詢優化。","locale":"zh-TW"},"34":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#核心章節導覽","content":"**內部程式碼與 Model 結構**\\\n深入解析 Mongoose Schema 生成邏輯與 Search Parameter Query Handler 內部運作。","locale":"zh-TW"},"35":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#核心章節導覽","content":"**FHIR 驗證器**\\\n使用內建或外部驗證工具對輸入之 FHIR 資源進行結構與規範校驗。","locale":"zh-TW"},"36":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2#預覽下一代架構","content":"如果您正在規劃系統升級或希望體驗次世代功能，歡迎瀏覽 &#x2A;*Burni v3 (Preview)** 文件，搶先了解 Express 5、雙資料庫時序資料儲存（Temporal Migration）及增強型 FHIR 系統參數等全新突破！","locale":"zh-TW"},"37":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","type":"page","content":"介紹","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","locale":"zh-TW"},"38":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni FHIR Server","locale":"zh-TW"},"39":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"Server 能力聲明","locale":"zh-TW"},"40":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni 使用 Node.JS 、Express 框架以及 MongoDB 實作 FHIR R4 Server，經由簡單的設定即可產生指定 FHIR Resource的 Mongoose Schema、API程式碼並可自行更改，滿足需求。目前Burni支援Windows以及Linux，讓開發人員可以快速架設 FHIR Server。","locale":"zh-TW"},"41":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni 所使用的 FHIR 版本為 v4.0.1。","locale":"zh-TW"},"42":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"Burni 使用 AEGIS Touchstone Basic-R4-Server 測試.","locale":"zh-TW"},"43":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"測試結果:","locale":"zh-TW"},"44":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"FHIR4-0-1-Basic-Server version 18 (2,216 tests has been passed, 100% Pass)","locale":"zh-TW"},"45":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"FHIR4-0-1-Basic-Server version 14 (1,948 tests has been passed, 100% Pass)","locale":"zh-TW"},"46":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"page","content":"Burni v3 概覽 (Preview)","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v3 (Preview)"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","locale":"zh-TW"},"47":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","content":"Burni v3 次世代架構與全新特性亮點","locale":"zh-TW"},"48":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#burni-v3-preview-全新特性概覽","content":"Burni v3 (Preview) 全新特性概覽","locale":"zh-TW"},"49":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-2","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-核心革新亮點","content":"🌟 核心革新亮點","locale":"zh-TW"},"50":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-3","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"1\\. 核心技術棧升級","locale":"zh-TW"},"51":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-4","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"2\\. 雙資料庫與時序架構（Dual Database & Temporal Architecture）","locale":"zh-TW"},"52":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"3\\. 增強的 FHIR 系統層級搜尋參數（System Search Parameters）","locale":"zh-TW"},"53":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#4-品質保證與現代化工程標準","content":"4\\. 品質保證與現代化工程標準","locale":"zh-TW"},"54":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-章節閱讀導覽","content":"📚 章節閱讀導覽","locale":"zh-TW"},"55":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#burni-v3-preview-全新特性概覽","content":"**Burni v3** 是 Burni FHIR Server 的重大里程碑升級。在繼承 v2 優良的 FHIR R4 合規性與高穩定性的基礎上，v3 全面革新了核心底層架構，針對現代化雲端原生環境、大規模醫療資料儲存以及高效能檢索需求進行了深度重構。","locale":"zh-TW"},"56":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"**Node.js >= 22 (LTS)**：充分利用現代 JavaScript 語言特性與 V8 引擎的高效能表現。","locale":"zh-TW"},"57":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"**Express 5 (5.2.1)**：核心框架升級至 Express 5，改善非同步路由錯誤處理（Promise rejection handling）、更安全的 Query Parser，提升 HTTP 處理效率。","locale":"zh-TW"},"58":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"**Mongoose 8 (8.24+)**：升級至最新世代的 MongoDB ODM，提供更強大的 TypeScript 型別支援與更高效的連線池管理。","locale":"zh-TW"},"59":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#1-核心技術棧升級","content":"**fhir-tool 5.0.2**：取代舊版 fhir 套件，採用更輕量且針對 R4 規格高度優化的解析與驗證工具。","locale":"zh-TW"},"60":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"在醫療臨床應用中，FHIR 資源的每一次更新（Update）與刪除（Delete）都必須保留完整的歷史版本與操作記錄（Provenance / History）。然而，將大量的歷史時序資料與目前有效資源（Active Resources）混存於同一個資料庫集合中，會嚴重影響日常查詢效能。","locale":"zh-TW"},"61":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"v3 引入了全新的**雙資料庫拓撲架構**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"62":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"**主要資料庫 (Primary DB)**：專注儲存當前有效的 Active FHIR 資源，索引緊湊、查詢與搜尋極速。","locale":"zh-TW"},"63":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-16","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"**時序歷史資料庫 (Temporal DB)**：專門負責持久化歷史版本（`_history`）、vread 操作與審計 Provenance 資料。","locale":"zh-TW"},"64":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-17","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#2-雙資料庫與時序架構dual-database--temporal-architecture","content":"**串流遷移與預檢機制**：提供 `temporal:preflight` 與 `temporal:migrate` 命令，支援平滑漸進式搬遷與資料完整性驗證。","locale":"zh-TW"},"65":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"v3 針對 FHIR 標準定義的系統全域參數進行了全面實作與底層優化：","locale":"zh-TW"},"66":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"**`_tag`**：支援依據 Coding（系統代碼/值）精準與多條件過濾資源。","locale":"zh-TW"},"67":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-20","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"**`_security`**：提供針對機密等級（Security Labels）的快速權限與合規過濾。","locale":"zh-TW"},"68":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-21","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"**`_profile`**：支援依據 StructureDefinition Canonical URI 檢索符合特定 Profile 的資源。","locale":"zh-TW"},"69":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-22","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#3-增強的-fhir-系統層級搜尋參數system-search-parameters","content":"**完整日期與時區精度**：修正 date / dateTime 查詢在跨時區與不同精度（年、月、日、分、秒、毫秒）下的查詢邊界，完全符合 HL7 FHIR 規範。","locale":"zh-TW"},"70":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-23","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#4-品質保證與現代化工程標準","content":"**全資源 CRUD 整合測試門禁（`npm run test:all-resource-crud`）**：涵蓋 FHIR R4 Catalog 全部 146 項資源的自動化 Create / Read / History 驗證。","locale":"zh-TW"},"71":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-24","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#4-品質保證與現代化工程標準","content":"**診斷 CI 閘門（Diagnostics Gate）**：自動化驗證所有搜尋參數的型別定義與執行路徑。","locale":"zh-TW"},"72":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-25","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#4-品質保證與現代化工程標準","content":"**Mocha 12 + Chai 6 + ESLint 10 Flat Config**：全面導入現代化測試與代碼規範體系。","locale":"zh-TW"},"73":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3-26","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3#-章節閱讀導覽","content":"**介紹**：了解 Burni v3 核心特點與 AEGIS Touchstone Conformance 測試能力聲明。","locale":"zh-TW"},"74":{"id":"/zh-TW/doc