erver，經由簡單的設定即可產生指定 FHIR Resource 的 Mongoose Schema 與 API 程式碼，並可自由擴充與客製化以滿足臨床與業務需求。目前 Burni 完整支援 Windows 與 Linux 環境，讓醫療資訊工程人員能快速架設高效能、符合規範的 FHIR Server。","locale":"zh-TW"},"84":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-5","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"Burni 所使用的 FHIR 版本為 &#x2A;*v4.0.1 (R4)**。","locale":"zh-TW"},"85":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-6","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"在 **v3** 版本中，核心技術棧與底層架構進行了全面現代化升級：","locale":"zh-TW"},"86":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-7","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"**Node.js >= 22 (LTS)** 與 **Express 5**，提供更優異的非同步錯誤處理與高並發吞吐量。","locale":"zh-TW"},"87":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-8","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"**Mongoose 8**，提供強健的 ODM 連線管理與現代化驅動支援。","locale":"zh-TW"},"88":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"**雙資料庫與時序架構（Dual Database & Temporal Architecture）**，將即時資源與歷史版本/審計（Provenance）分離持久化。","locale":"zh-TW"},"89":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#burni-fhir-server","content":"**系統層級搜尋參數**，原生支援 `_tag`、`_security`、`_profile` 以及全精度時區日期區間查詢。","locale":"zh-TW"},"90":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction#server-能力聲明","content":"Burni 使用 AEGIS Touchstone Basic-R4-Server 嚴格測試，展現 100% 的規格相容性：","locale":"zh-TW"},"91":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/introduction","tags":[],"type":"text