W"},"162":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-9","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"僅存放最新的 Active 資源版本。","locale":"zh-TW"},"163":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-10","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"資料庫容量精簡，索引可常駐記憶體（Working Set），大幅提升日常臨床檢索與 RESTful API 的回應速度。","locale":"zh-TW"},"164":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-11","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"**Temporal DB（時序歷史資料庫）**：","locale":"zh-TW"},"165":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-12","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"存放所有資源的歷史修訂版（`_history` 集合）、HTTP 請求關聯紀錄與 Provenance 審計資料。","locale":"zh-TW"},"166":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-13","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#1-職責分離-separation-of-concerns","content":"針對時間序列（Timestamp）、版本編號（`versionId`）進行複合索引優化。","locale":"zh-TW"},"167":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-14","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#2-資料一致性與-provenance-保證","content":"在 v3 中，針對資源更新的歷史歸檔流程進行了精準強化：","locale":"zh-TW"},"168":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-15","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture#2-資料一致性與-provenance-保證","content":"**BundleRequest Provenance 保全**：確保在交易（Transaction）與批次操作下，每個版本都能完整對應到發起請求的 HTTP 標頭與使用者識別。","locale":"zh-TW"},"169":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v3/temporal-architecture-16","page