，以及 Identifier/ContactPoint 的 system-value correlation；`:text` 查詢不建立 derived index。","locale":"zh-TW"},"379":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-18","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**reference**：只索引 stored `reference` field；`Reference.type` target guard 仍由 runtime filter 負責。","locale":"zh-TW"},"380":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-19","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**string**：只為 exact projected leaf 建立 equality index；default prefix 與 `:contains` 維持 regex 語意，不宣稱 B-tree index。","locale":"zh-TW"},"381":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-20","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**number / quantity**：使用現有 numeric BSON field；`sa`、`eb`、`ap` comparator 尚未支援，不進 capability matrix。","locale":"zh-TW"},"382":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-21","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**uri**：使用 raw URI single-field index；`:above` / `:below` 共用同一 raw key identity。","locale":"zh-TW"},"383":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-22","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**array correlation**：只接受可證明的單一 array scope；parallel multikey、positional path 與 unsafe branch 會產生 rejection diagnostic。","locale":"zh-TW"},"384":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-23","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"**Database 自訂 SearchParameter** 預設仍可正常執行查詢，但**不會**進入 desired index manifest，因此不建立 derived index。這不代表查詢被禁止，只代表可能使用 COLLSCAN。若缺少 performance index，請以 `npm run mongodb:verify` 檢查 drift，並在部署流程執行 `npm run mongodb:provision`。","locale":"zh-TW"},"385":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-24","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"期望的 derived index 狀態合併在執行時產生的 desired index manifest；詳細部署步驟見 部署 的 MongoDB provisioning 章節。","locale":"zh-TW"},"386":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview-25","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/search-parameter/overview#非-temporal-derived-index-邊界","content":"下一章您將會知道如何修正 Burni 遺失或錯誤的搜尋參數。下一章自行新增搜尋參數","locale":"zh-TW"},"387":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler","type":"page","content":"searchParameterQueryHandler","breadcrumbs":["Docs","v2 (LTS)","Code api documentation","Models","程式碼文件"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler","locale":"zh-TW"},"388":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler-0","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler#functions","content":"Functions","locale":"zh-TW"},"389":{"id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler-1","page_id":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-TW/docs/v2/code-api-documentation/models/fhir/search-parameter-query-handler#getst